#: app/templates/support.html:76 app/templates/sustainable.html:10
msgid ""
"Learn modern and eco-friendly farming techniques that improve productivity "
"while protecting the environment for future generations."
msgstr ""
"भविष्यातील पिढ्यांसाठी पर्यावरणाचे संरक्षण करताना उत्पादकता सुधारणारी आधुनिक"
